{
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.ancient": "[sine]……醒来……有光的……信使……\n……向上……杀死……建筑师……[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.next": "回应",
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.char": "哇，连收件人都替我填好了？\n不过，包裹里装着什么，我得先弄清楚。",
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.ancient": "[sine]……我的……祝福……\n……他的……终结……[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.next": "回应",
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-3.char": "祝福我收下啦。至于该向谁开火，我会亲眼确认。",
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.ancient": "[sine]……又……回来了……\n……还在……微笑……？[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-1r.char": "总不能让等我的人，一见面就替我担心吧？\n来，今天换条路线！",
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.ancient": "[sine]……我能……让你……忘记……\n……那些……痛苦……[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.next": "回应",
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.char": "那会不会连老姐、朋友，还有答应过的事一起忘掉？",
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-2.ancient": "[sine]……你会……轻松……很多……[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-2.next": "回应",
  "NEOW.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-3.char": "免啦。行李是重了点，可不能把收件人的名字也扔掉。",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.ancient": "嘿，头顶发光的姑娘！找点什么？我这儿什么都有！",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.next": "回应",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.char": "铳械零件、唱片，还有能装下它们的货箱！\n你这里需要一个物流顾问吗？",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.ancient": "顾问？你可别把我的宝贝按什么规矩挪来挪去！",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.next": "回应",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-3.char": "懂了，老板亲自维护的神秘分类法。我熟。",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.ancient": "又来了？那个箱子里有好东西！呃……也可能是旁边那个！",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-1r.char": "没关系，我带着找失踪快递的耐心呢。",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.ancient": "这堆旧东西都没人要啦，你倒翻得挺起劲！",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.next": "回应",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.char": "旧不等于没用嘛。\n有人留着一张旧唱片，是因为记得一起听歌的人。",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-2.ancient": "嘿！你这姑娘懂行！那可不能随便扔！",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-2.next": "回应",
  "DARV.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-3.char": "所以放心，挑中的东西我会好好用。不是带出去换零钱。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.ancient": "多么精巧的光饰！可惜，你竟让它配着一身赶路的衣服。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.next": "回应",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.char": "谢谢！不过这套能跑、能跳，口袋还装得下弹匣。\n要改的话，口袋可得留下。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.ancient": "实用……何其有限的追求。走近些，让我改善你的品味。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.next": "回应",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-3.char": "那就麻烦你，让尖塔见识一下最华丽的快递员吧！",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.ancient": "又把自己弄得灰头土脸了？我的赐福可不是让你拿去蒙尘的。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-1r.char": "那可是前排的位置，没一件藏在箱底哦。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.ancient": "带着我的恩赐，人们理当仰望你。你却仍和他们挤在一起？",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.next": "回应",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.char": "站太远，连谁在笑都看不清，派对还有什么意思？",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-2.ancient": "至少该让他们懂得，自己有多么幸运。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-2.next": "回应",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-3.char": "当然。我也挺幸运的，能和他们坐一桌。",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.ancient": "亮圈圈！会飘！怎么做到的？！\n可以摸？可以摘？！",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.next": "回应",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.char": "哎哎，这个不送！我还没找到它的开关呢。\n要看看证章吗？这个可以拿近一点。",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.ancient": "小小的！亮亮的！好东西！\n我也有！看，看！",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.ancient": "发光朋友！带故事了？！",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-1r.char": "带了！这次从一场差点拆掉屋顶的演唱会讲起。",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-2r.ancient": "屋顶不要拆！故事要听！",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.ancient": "你也有武器！要打建筑师？\n不要打！说话好！",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.next": "回应",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.char": "我也喜欢能坐下来聊天的委托。\n可要是他不肯听，还冲别人动手呢？",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-2.ancient": "再说！大声说！很大声！",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-2.next": "回应",
  "OROBAS.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-3.char": "好，我先喊他一声。要是能省下子弹，我请你听整晚的故事。",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.ancient": "[thinky_dots]那道光……有点晃眼。\n你也来取走我的一部分么……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.next": "回应",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.char": "抱歉抱歉，我侧着站。\n不过，你真的不疼吗？",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.ancient": "[thinky_dots]睡一觉……就会长好。\n拿去吧，让你的路好走些……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.next": "回应",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-3.char": "谢谢。那我小声一点，祝你好梦。",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.ancient": "[thinky_dots]信使……还没有休息么……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-1r.char": "还有一段路。你先睡，我把电台关小。",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.ancient": "[thinky_dots]如果见到父亲……\n告诉他，我还在这里……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.next": "回应",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.char": "嗯，我会把这句话带到。",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-2.ancient": "[thinky_dots]即使……你是去伤害他的……？[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-2.next": "回应",
  "PAEL.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-3.char": "该拦住的事，我会拦住。\n可有人在等他，这也该让他知道。",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.ancient": "[b]发光的战士！你带了多少武器！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.next": "回应",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.char": "够应付路上的麻烦，不够满足我的收藏欲！",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.ancient": "[b]好回答！！拿上更多！然后与我一战！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.next": "回应",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-3.char": "先说好，靶场安全线以内不许站人。你也一样！",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.ancient": "[b]你的武器又在打雷了！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-1r.char": "听出来啦？今天的节奏还不错吧！",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-2r.ancient": "[b]再响一点！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.ancient": "[b]能天使！这次不许只打靶！与我一战！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.next": "回应",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.char": "来吧，点到为止！我还有货要送呢。",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.next": "切磋",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-2.char": "[i][font_size=22]能天使在轰鸣与大笑声中清空了弹匣。[/font_size][/i]",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-2.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-3.ancient": "[b]痛快！！可惜你换弹的时候太安静了！！[/b]",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.ancient": "哎呀，小可爱，你把光都带进来了。\n让我给你添一把[jitter][b]火[/b][/jitter]，怎么样？",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.next": "回应",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.char": "听上去不错！不过我背包里有弹药，咱们先商量好火候。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.ancient": "别紧张，亲爱的。我最会照顾[jitter][b]易燃[/b][/jitter]的小东西。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.ancient": "又饿着肚子赶路？过来，我准备了些[jitter][b]热乎[/b][/jitter]的东西。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-1r.char": "有苹果派吗？啊，先等等，我得确认一下那个馅。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.ancient": "你笑得真甜。有什么难过的事，让我替你[jitter][b]烧掉[/b][/jitter]吧。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.next": "回应",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.char": "可别。有些事想起来不好受，也还是得记住。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-2.ancient": "舍不得呀？那可是会一直[jitter][b]疼[/b][/jitter]的。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-2.next": "回应",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-3.char": "所以才得找朋友吃饭、听歌嘛。\n烤箱留给晚餐就好。",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.ancient": "一位天使来到了我的面前。你想用什么，换取我的力量？",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.next": "回应",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.char": "先看报价，再看条款。\n尤其是小字，麻烦写得和标题一样大。",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.ancient": "谨慎的信使。契约可不会因为你读懂了，就变得仁慈。",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.next": "回应",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-3.char": "总比签完才发现要替别人还债好。拿来看看吧。",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.ancient": "你又需要我了。光环并没有让你少付一点代价，不是么？",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-1r.char": "它又不是打折券。来，说说这次的条件。",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.ancient": "你向那不回应的神祈祷，却要从恶魔手中获得力量。多么动人。",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-0.next": "回应",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.char": "祈祷的时候，我想着的可不只有神。",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-1.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-2.ancient": "你的朋友？我也可以把他们写进契约。",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-2.next": "回应",
  "VAKUU.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.2-3.char": "那就免谈。我的名字我自己签，他们的命不在报价里。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.ancient": "又一个戴着光环来宣告审判的？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-0.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.char": "能天使，物流从业者。\n不过，沿途的事，我确实想找你问问。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-1.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.ancient": "我不需要向涅奥的傀儡解释。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-2.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-3.char": "那就看着我，别看光环。\n现在站在这里、决定扣扳机的人，是我。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.0-endattack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.ancient": "又来了。你还不明白这里的秩序？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-1r.char": "看见了。问题是，被当成代价的人，好像都没机会说话。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-2r.ancient": "所以你要替他们制造噪音？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-2r.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-3r.char": "嘿，我嗓门是挺大的。至少，不能让这里只剩你的声音。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.AK_EXUSIAI_CHARACTER_EXUSIAI.1-endattack": "Both",
